<title>UK: Ford unit sets C$100 mln five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Ford unit sets C$100 mln five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager RBC Dominion Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD CREDIT CANADA LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  FORD MOTOR CREDIT CO (RATED A1/A+)</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    16.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.67    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.095   SPREAD	+31 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    30 BP     SELL CONC   1.575</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT MAY 2001 CANADAS.</p>
<p> NOTES	LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
